    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingZaJu_L001",
      "original_quote": "定雜局風雲際會⾝命雖弱⼆限逢祿⾺是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingZaJu_L002",
      "original_quote": "錦上添花謂限破惡星⽽⾏吉地是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingZaJu_L003",
      "original_quote": "祿衰⾺困限逢七殺祿⾺空亡是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingZaJu_L004",
      "original_quote": "衣錦還鄉少年不遂四⼗後⾏墓運是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingZaJu_L005",
      "original_quote": "步數無依前限接後限連綿不分是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingZaJu_L006",
      "original_quote": "⽔上駕星⼀年好⼀年不好是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingZaJu_L007",
      "original_quote": "吉凶相伴命有主星限前則發限衰不發是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingZaJu_L008",
      "original_quote": "枯⽊逢春謂命衰限好是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    }
